0..78 Comment "//! A string\'s methods: a module member whose first parameter is its receiver,"
79..155 Comment "//! `self`, written with the mode the receiver is lent in, called off a held"
156..235 Comment "//! string as `s.len()`. A call is the access its mode names: a shared receiver"
236..312 Comment "//! is lent for reading, an exclusive one, written with no mode, is lent and"
313..387 Comment "//! written back, and a consumed one is taken, ending its hold (the `let`,"
388..464 Comment "//! `inout` and `sink` conventions of [Racordon-2023-borrow_checking_hylo])."
465..468 Comment "//!"
469..505 Comment "//! - see: #1488 — `takenInOneArm`"
506..555 Comment "//! - cites: [Racordon-2023-borrow_checking_hylo]"
556..559 Comment "//!"
